5 EP&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=20&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=329552","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/329552","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=329552&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":329546,"name":"Omar Featuring Stevie Wonder  | The Remixes EP","slug":"omar-featuring-stevie-wonder-the-remixes-ep","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/shop\/vinyl\/omar-featuring-stevie-wonder-the-remixes-ep\/","sku":"PJ313","short_description":"<p>The much awaited re issue from Peppermint Jam of the Omar Remix EP featuring the highly sought after Henrik Schwarz rework of &#8216;Feeling You&#8217; Featuring Stevie Wonder, along with 3 other killer remixes including the sublime Andre Lodemann Remix of Lay It Down.<\/p>\n<p>Limited repress so act fast to avoid disappointment!<\/p>","description":"<p>The much awaited re issue from Peppermint Jam of the Omar Remix EP featuring the highly sought after Henrik Schwarz rework of &#8216;Feeling You&#8217; Featuring Stevie Wonder, along with 3 other killer remixes including the sublime Andre Lodemann Remix of Lay It Down.<\/p>\n<p>Limited repress so act fast to avoid disappointment!<\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"329546\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-aft