 in the clubs over recent weeks with a strong reception from a massive cross section of DJs. Cuts vary from French Touch style disco-house to out-and-out electro filth.<\/p>","description":"<p>This new EP and revival of his Nite Rite series from Dutch electronic maestro Mason (he of chart topping Exceeder fame) comes in the form of four very individual cuts aimed squarely at the dancefloor. Typically eclectic and fresh sounding, these four cuts have been doing damage in the clubs over recent weeks with a strong reception from a massive cross section of DJs. Cuts vary from French Touch style disco-house to out-and-out electro filth.<\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"329516\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-after tinvwl-loop\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"329516\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-productvariations=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\"><span class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist-text\">Add to Wishlist<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"tinvwl-tooltip\">Add to Wishlist<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1799","regular_price":"1799","sale_price":"1799","price_range":null,"currency_code":"EUR","currency_symbol":"\u20ac","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20ac ","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&euro;<\/span>&nbsp;17.99<\/span><span class=\"price-suffix\"><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":329521,"src"