,"permalink":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/shop\/vinyl\/various-artists-king-street-sounds-sampler-vol-7-ep\/","sku":"KSSV010","short_description":"<p>King Street Sounds Sampler Vol. 7 continues the long-running series from the legendary King Street Sounds catalogue, bringing together a selection of classic house cuts from some of the label\u2019s most respected artists.<\/p>\n<p>Featuring productions from Mood II Swing, Jovonn, Roy Davis Jr. and Osunlade, the release highlights the soulful, groove-led house sound that has defined King Street across decades of dancefloor culture.<\/p>\n<p>Including standout tracks such as Mood II Swing\u2019s Nafara and Osunlade\u2019s The Fifth Dimension, the sampler brings together several proven records in one DJ-friendly vinyl package.<\/p>\n<p>With warm grooves, musical depth and timeless club arrangements, these proven King Street records offer strong crossover appeal for both long-time house collectors and DJs looking for reliable dancefloor material.<\/p>\n<p>As the seventh edition in the King Street sampler series, this release presents a selection of essential house cuts on one highly playable vinyl release.<\/p>\n<p>A strong catalogue addition for stores serving soulful and deep house buyers.<\/p>","description":"<p>King Street Sounds Sampler Vol. 7 continues the long-running series from the legendary King Street Sounds catalogue, bringing together a selection of classic house cuts from some of the label\u2019s most respected artists.<\/p>\n<p>Featuring productions from Mood II Swing, Jovonn, Roy Davis Jr. and Osunlade, the release highlights the soulful, groove-led house sound that has defined King Street across decades of dancefloor culture.<\/p>\n<p>Including standout tracks such as Mood II Swing\u2019s Nafara and Osunlade\u2019s The Fifth Dimension, the sampler brings together several proven records in one DJ-friendly vinyl package.<\/p>\n<p>With warm grooves, musical depth and timeless club arrangements, these proven King Street records offer strong crossover appeal for both long-time house collectors and DJs looking for reliable dancefloor material.<\/p>\n<p>As the seventh edition in the King Street sampler series, this release presents a selection of essential house cuts on one highly playable vinyl release.<\/p>\n<p>A strong catalogue addition for stores serving soulful and deep house buyers.<\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"329489\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-after tinvwl-loop\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"329489\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-productvariations=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\"><span class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist-text\">Add to Wishlist<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"tinvwl-tooltip\">Add to Wishlist<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1799","regular_price":"1799","sale_price":"1799","price_range":null,"currency_code":"EUR","currency_symbol":"\u20ac","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20ac ","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&euro;<\/span>&nbsp;17.99<\/span><span class=\"price-suffix\"><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":329495,"src":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/rel.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/rel-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/rel.jpg 700w, 