ence-funktion-12\/","sku":"R004","short_description":"<p>2 classic HMC cuts taken from the 1992 Science Funktion &amp; 1995 Southern Cross EP\u2019s respectively, focussing on HMC\u2019s deeper house style, an essential release for collectors and DJs alike.<\/p>\n<p>Both tracks will cost you \u00a3200 + on Discogs, here&#8217;s your chance to own both for a fraction of the cost.<\/p>","description":"<p>2 classic HMC cuts taken from the 1992 Science Funktion &amp; 1995 Southern Cross EP\u2019s respectively, focussing on HMC\u2019s deeper house style, an essential release for collectors and DJs alike.<\/p>\n<p>Both tracks will cost you \u00a3200 + on Discogs, here&#8217;s your chance to own both for a fraction of the cost.<\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"329473\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-after tinvwl-loop\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"329473\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-productvariations=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\"><span class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist-text\">Add to Wishlist<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"tinvwl-tooltip\">Add to Wishlist<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1799","regular_price":"1799","sale_price":"1799","price_range":null,"currency_code":"EUR","currency_symbol":"\u20ac","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20ac ","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&euro;<\/span>&nbsp;17.99<\/span><span class=\"