","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Add to cart","description":"Add to cart: &ldquo;Melchior Sultana | Rhodes In The Middle (Incl. Gerd Janson Remix) 12&#8243;&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=20&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=329446","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/329446","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=329446&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":329439,"name":"Dirty Channels | Jungle Echoes EP","slug":"dirty-channels-jungle-echoes-ep","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/shop\/vinyl\/dirty-channels-jungle-echoes-ep\/","sku":"RNTR088","short_description":"<p>Milan&#8217;s Dirty Channels bring their polished club sound to RNT with the Jungle Echoes EP, seamlessly marrying influences of various international dance-floor vibes. Guilty and its accompanying Guilty (Dub) have a euphoric energy that feels predestined for Euro festival season, while the uptempo and hypnotic Semliki incorporates elements of South African Kwaito. Rounding out the EP is the deeply brooding title track which evokes the proto house sonics of 90s Chicago and NYC making the Jungle Echoes EP the duos strongest production statement to date and an eminently playable 12 Inch.<\/p>","description":"<p>Milan&#8217;s Dirty Channels bring their polished club sound to RNT with the Jungle Echoes EP, seamlessly marrying influences of various international dance-floor vibes. Guilty and its accompanying Guilty (Dub) have a euphoric energy that feels predestined for Euro festival season, while the uptempo and hypnotic Semliki incorporates elements of South African Kwaito. Rounding out the EP is the deeply brooding title track which evokes the proto house sonics of 90s Chicago and NYC making the Jungle Echoes EP the duos strongest production statement to date and an eminently playable 12 Inch.<\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"329439\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-after tinvwl-loop\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"329439\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-productvariations=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\"><span class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist-text\">Add to Wishlist<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"tinvwl-tooltip\">Add to Wishlist<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1850","regular_price":"1850","sale_price":"1850","price_range":null,"currency_code":"EUR","currency_symbol":"\u20ac","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20ac ","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&euro;<\/span>&nbsp;18.50<\/span><span class=\"price-suffix\"><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":329445,"src":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15.jpg 700w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-250x250.jpg 250w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-100x100.jpg 100w","sizes":"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-250x250.jpg 250w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-15.jpg 700w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"li2","alt":""}],"categories":[],"tags":[{"id":7631,"name":"store","slug":"store","link":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/tags\/store\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[{"id":1,"name":"Artist","taxonomy":"pa_artist","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12880,"name":"Dirty Channels","slug":"dirty-channels"}]},{"id":5,"name":"Format","taxonomy":"pa_format","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":7393,"name":"EP","slug":"ep"}]},{"id":2,"name":"Genre","taxonomy":"pa_genre","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":2006,"name":"Deep House","slug":"deep-house"},{"id":30,"name":"House","slug":"house"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Label","taxonomy":"pa_label","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":1225,"name":"Razor N Tape","slug":"razor-n-tape"}]},{"id":4,"name":"Status","taxonomy":"pa_status","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6747,"name":"New Arrivals","slug":"new-arrivals"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"In stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Add to cart","description":"Add to cart: &ldquo;Dirty Channels | Jungle Echoes EP&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=20&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=desc&#038;add-to-cart=329439","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/329439","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=329439&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":329433,"name":"DJ Soch | Let Me Tell You 12&#8243;","slug":"dj-soch-let-me-tell-you-12","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/shop\/vinyl\/dj-soch-let-me-tell-you-12\/","sku":"WOLFEP088","short_description":"<p>For WOLFEP088, we\u2019re welcoming an Italian stallion to the WOLF stable. DJ Soch is a renowned DJ, producer, and label owner whose roots in house music run deep. Beginning his journey behind the decks in the mid-1980s, he has spent more than four decades honing a sound shaped by house, techno, disco, funk, hip-hop, and the timeless influence of Detroit and Chicago. As the founder of Black Angus Records and a resident DJ at the renowned Italian club Serendipity, he has shared lineups with some of the best to ever do it, helping to shape Italy\u2019s underground electronic music scene.<\/p>\n<p>When his tracks hit the WOLF inbox, we knew we were onto something special. The first one we heard, \u2018Let Me Tell You\u2019, was an instant yes, must sign moment. There\u2019s skippy drums, warm keys, church organ, a heavy bassline and a pleading, soulful male vocal. One of those tracks that should come with a neck-brace. Soulful, but powerful. There\u2019s also a \u2018Power Mix\u2019 version that keeps all the elements we loved, but strips back the vocal and ramps up the church organ. Absolute Holy Ghoster! This is the type of track that would have torn up the dance floor at the Shelter, a real Timmy Regisford tops-off jam.<\/p>\n<p>On the flip, there\u2019s a hypnotic deep house groove entitled, \u2018Chewing Gum\u2019. This is proper stuff, heads-down, deep house for the dance floor. We\u2019ve paired it with a remix from Prince Palmer, one of the standout remixers of recent years, and a great group of guys. The Prince has delivered a reinterpretation that gives a nod to 90s US Garage, complete with all the trademark production chops you would expect from a regular on the stellar Bobby Donny label. It\u2019s a track that wouldn\u2019t sound out of place on a peak-period Strictly Rhythm 12\u201d, so that\u2019s all you need to know.<\/p>\n<p>Four belters, all on one record, designed for maximum listening pleasure.<\/p>","description":"<p>For WOLFEP088, we\u2019re welcoming an Italian stallion to the WOLF stable. DJ Soch is a renowned DJ, producer, and label owner whose roots in house music run deep. Beginning his journey behind the decks in the mid-1980s, he has spent more than four decades honing a sound shaped by house, techno, disco, funk, hip-hop, and the timeless influence of Detroit and Chicago. As the founder of Black Angus Records and a resident DJ at the renowned Italian club Serendipity, he has shared lineups with some of the best to ever do it, helping to shape Italy\u2019s underground electronic music scene.<\/p>\n<p>When his tracks hit the WOLF inbox, we knew we were onto something special. The first one we heard, \u2018Let Me Tell You\u2019, was an instant yes, must sign moment. There\u2019s skippy drums, warm keys, church organ, a heavy bassline and a pleading, soulful male vocal. One of those tracks that should come with a neck-brace. Soulful, but powerful. There\u2019s also a \u2018Power Mix\u2019 version that keeps all the elements we loved, but strips back the vocal and ramps up the church organ. Absolute Holy Ghoster! This is the type of track that would have torn up the dance floor at the Shelter, a real Timmy Regisford tops-off jam.<\/p>\n<p>On the flip, there\u2019s a hypnotic deep house groove entitled, \u2018Chewing Gum\u2019. This is proper stuff, heads-down, deep house for the dance floor. We\u2019ve paired it with a remix from Prince Palmer, one of the standout remixers of recent years, and a great group of guys. The Prince has delivered a reinterpretation that gives a nod to 90s US Garage, complete with all the trademark production chops you would expect from a regular on the stellar Bobby Donny label. It\u2019s a track that wouldn\u2019t sound out of place on a peak-period Strictly Rhythm 12\u201d, so that\u2019s all you need to know.<\/p>\n<p>Four belters, all on one record, designed for maximum listening pleasure.<\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wraper woocommerce tinv-wishlist tinvwl-shortcode-add-to-cart tinvwl-loop-button-wrapper tinvwl-woocommerce_product_get_description\" data-tinvwl_product_id=\"329433\">\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" name=\"add-to-wishlist\" aria-label=\"Add to Wishlist\" class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist_button tinvwl-icon-heart  tinvwl-position-after tinvwl-loop\" data-tinv-wl-list=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-product=\"329433\" data-tinv-wl-productvariation=\"0\" data-tinv-wl-productvariations=\"[]\" data-tinv-wl-producttype=\"simple\" data-tinv-wl-action=\"add\"><span class=\"tinvwl_add_to_wishlist-text\">Add to Wishlist<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"tinv-wishlist-clear\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"tinvwl-tooltip\">Add to Wishlist<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1850","regular_price":"1850","sale_price":"1850","price_range":null,"currency_code":"EUR","currency_symbol":"\u20ac","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20ac ","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&euro;<\/span>&nbsp;18.50<\/span><span class=\"price-suffix\"><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":329438,"src":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14.jpg 700w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-250x250.jpg 250w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-100x100.jpg 100w","sizes":"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-250x250.jpg 250w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/li2-14.jpg 700w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"li2","alt":""}],"categories":[],"tags":[{"id":7631,"name":"store","slug":"store","link":"https:\/\/bordelloaparigi.com\/tags\/store\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[{"id":1,"name":"Artist","taxonomy":"pa_artist","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":11249,"name":"